### 总览：企业字段 / 全局配置下的普通对象 / 默认 ObjectMapper 文本
GET http://localhost:8026/api/jackson/overview

### 只看企业订单
GET http://localhost:8026/api/jackson/orders/sample

### 反序列化：字符串主键 + 数字状态码 + 两种日期
POST http://localhost:8026/api/jackson/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "9007199254740993",
  "createdAt": "2026-11-23 08:30:00",
  "paidAt": "2026/11/23 09:05",
  "status": 20,
  "amountCent": 1990
}

### 反序列化：数字主键 + 枚举名
POST http://localhost:8026/api/jackson/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 9007199254740993,
  "createdAt": "2026-11-23 08:30:00",
  "status": "PAID",
  "amountCent": 1
}

### ISO-8601 的 LocalDateTime 会被拒绝（code=400）
POST http://localhost:8026/api/jackson/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "1",
  "createdAt": "2026-11-23T08:30:00",
  "status": 10,
  "amountCent": 1
}
